{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38106","headline":"见别离者因赠之 · 韩偓","name":"见别离者因赠之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"征人草草尽戎装，征马萧萧立路傍。\n尊酒阑珊将远别，秋山迤逦更斜阳。\n白髭兄弟中年後，瘴海程途万里长。\n曾向天涯怀此恨，见君呜咽更凄凉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38106.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38106","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}